    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d9">

                <pb facs="0011" n="5" xml:id="pg5"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">810.24/45: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Peru</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Dreyfus</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lima</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1939-06-29T10:00:00-05:00">June 29, 1939—10
                            a.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 11:32 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>51. In reply to Department’s telegram of June 23 [<hi rendition="#italic"
                    >27</hi>], 7 p.m. the Minister for Foreign Affairs after consulting President
                    Benavides has informed me that he agrees in principle with the objectives of the
                    proposed resolution and looks with favor to its enactment.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dreyfus</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
